WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:01:06.755
Raccoon: I need to sit.

2
00:01:06.756 --> 00:01:10.217
I will sit on this log.

3
00:01:10.218 --> 00:01:29.372
Rabbit: I need to sit too.

4
00:01:29.373 --> 00:01:40.692
Raccoon: Sit next to me.

5
00:01:40.693 --> 00:02:16.119
Frog: I need to sit.

6
00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:21.720
Raccoon: Sit with us!

7
00:02:21.721 --> 00:02:27.139
Sit with us on the log.

8
00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:46.076
Frog: We are all sitting.

9
00:02:46.077 --> 00:03:03.901
Squirrel: Uh-oh! I can't sit on the log.

10
00:03:03.902 --> 00:03:13.333
Rabbit: Sit where I sat.

11
00:03:13.334 --> 00:03:22.903
I'll sit on that log.

12
00:03:22.904 --> 00:03:26.337
Frog: Don't sit on that!

13
00:03:26.338 --> 00:03:36.119
Rabbit: Whoa!

